# Two addresses per line, separated by a space. The predicate the confluence
# check runs: two `add` operations at disjoint addresses commute.

# The case #50 names. Both reach inside a kind that a previous operation
# declared, and the two are disjoint. A check that compared the text of an
# address would call them a conflict and refuse an overlay this repository has
# already committed.
kinds.design_spec.identifier kinds.design_spec.language

# A prefix in text is not a prefix in segments.
kinds.playbook kinds.playbook_step

# The genuine overlaps: the same address twice, and one above the other.
kinds.playbook kinds.playbook
kinds.design_spec kinds.design_spec.identifier
kinds kinds.playbook

# Different blocks never overlap.
kinds.playbook shelves.playbooks
